# AI-harness observability, all native services, no containers. Claude Code, Codex and
# Grok already export OTLP to localhost:4318; Alloy owns that port and fans out, so no
# harness config changes hands. Wired by scripts/configure/observability.sh.
#   alloy  :4318/:4317  OTLP in, standard paths every harness expects
#   prometheus   :9090  metrics, capped by --storage.tsdb.retention.size
#   victorialogs :9428  events, capped by -retention.maxDiskSpaceUsageBytes
#   grafana      :3000  dashboards (grafana.com IDs 25255, 25052)
# Sizing: eight Claude Code metrics at 60s plus event logs stays under 2 GB a year.
brew "grafana-alloy"
