# jj terminal UIs — Zed has no view of jj state, so a TUI fills the gap.
#   jjui    — Rust TUI (idursun), the gitui-style analogue; preferred, bound to
#             `space t j` in Zed.
#   lazyjj  — lazygit-style alternative, kept for parity with lazygit.
